[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 107 It's",
    "start": 0.69,
    "end": 4.752,
    "zh": "第107课 它",
    "zh_hant": "第107課 它"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "too small.",
    "start": 4.452,
    "end": 5.973,
    "zh": "太小了。",
    "zh_hant": "太小了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 7.334,
    "end": 10.415,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 10.175,
    "end": 12.196,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What kind of dress does the Lady want?",
    "start": 13.357,
    "end": 17.118,
    "zh": "那位女士想要什么样的连衣裙？",
    "zh_hant": "那位女士想要什麼樣的連衣裙？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Do you like this dress, madam?",
    "start": 19.2,
    "end": 22.321,
    "zh": "夫人，您喜欢这件连衣裙吗？",
    "zh_hant": "夫人，您喜歡這件連衣裙嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I like the colour very much.",
    "start": 23.522,
    "end": 26.703,
    "zh": "我非常喜欢这个颜色。",
    "zh_hant": "我非常喜歡這個顏色。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It's a lovely dress,",
    "start": 27.023,
    "end": 29.264,
    "zh": "这是一件漂亮的连衣裙，",
    "zh_hant": "這是一件漂亮的連衣裙，"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "but it's too small for me.",
    "start": 29.305,
    "end": 32.066,
    "zh": "但对我来说太小了。",
    "zh_hant": "但對我來說太小了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "What about this one?",
    "start": 33.227,
    "end": 35.487,
    "zh": "这件怎么样？",
    "zh_hant": "這件怎麼樣？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "It's a lovely dress.",
    "start": 35.768,
    "end": 38.069,
    "zh": "这是一件漂亮的连衣裙。",
    "zh_hant": "這是一件漂亮的連衣裙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "It's very smart.",
    "start": 38.369,
    "end": 40.47,
    "zh": "它非常时髦。",
    "zh_hant": "它非常時髦。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Short skirts are in fashion now.",
    "start": 41.011,
    "end": 44.232,
    "zh": "现在流行短裙。",
    "zh_hant": "現在流行短裙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Would you like to try it?",
    "start": 44.612,
    "end": 46.953,
    "zh": "您想试试吗？",
    "zh_hant": "您想試試嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "All right.",
    "start": 47.654,
    "end": 48.854,
    "zh": "好的。",
    "zh_hant": "好的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "I'm afraid this green dress",
    "start": 49.915,
    "end": 53.036,
    "zh": "恐怕这件绿裙子",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕這件綠裙子"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "is too small",
    "start": 52.997,
    "end": 54.937,
    "zh": "也太小了",
    "zh_hant": "也太小了"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "for me as well.",
    "start": 54.617,
    "end": 56.738,
    "zh": "对我来说。",
    "zh_hant": "對我來說。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "It's smaller than the blue one.",
    "start": 57.899,
    "end": 61.52,
    "zh": "它比那件蓝色的还小。",
    "zh_hant": "它比那件藍色的還小。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "I don't like the colour either.",
    "start": 62.681,
    "end": 65.642,
    "zh": "我也不喜欢这个颜色。",
    "zh_hant": "我也不喜歡這個顏色。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It doesn't suit me at all.",
    "start": 66.203,
    "end": 69.504,
    "zh": "它一点都不适合我。",
    "zh_hant": "它一點都不適合我。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I think the blue dress is prettier.",
    "start": 70.185,
    "end": 73.927,
    "zh": "我觉得那件蓝色的更漂亮。",
    "zh_hant": "我覺得那件藍色的更漂亮。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Could you show me another blue dress?",
    "start": 74.687,
    "end": 78.749,
    "zh": "您能给我看看另一件蓝裙子吗？",
    "zh_hant": "您能給我看看另一件藍裙子嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "I want a dress like that one,",
    "start": 79.53,
    "end": 82.573,
    "zh": "我想要一件像那样的连衣裙，",
    "zh_hant": "我想要一件像那樣的連衣裙，"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "but it must be my size.",
    "start": 82.754,
    "end": 86.017,
    "zh": "但必须是我的尺码。",
    "zh_hant": "但必須是我的尺碼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "I'm afraid I haven't got",
    "start": 87.379,
    "end": 90.462,
    "zh": "恐怕我没有",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕我沒有"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "a larger dress.",
    "start": 90.203,
    "end": 92.124,
    "zh": "更大号的连衣裙。",
    "zh_hant": "更大號的連衣裙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "This is the largest dress in the shop.",
    "start": 92.545,
    "end": 96.79,
    "zh": "这是店里最大号的连衣裙。",
    "zh_hant": "這是店裡最大號的連衣裙。"
  }
]
